March Update=0D
=0D
Dear Benjamin,=0D
=0D
I am thrilled to inform you that the call for speakers for the CATHY Days=
=0D
2023 has been a great success. We have received a higher than expected=0D=

number of responses, and I am delighted to announce that we have 18 confi=
rmed=0D
presentations for the workshop and almost 40 participants.=0D
=0D
So, what do you need to do in March?=0D
For attendees=0D
=0D
   -=0D
=0D
   =E2=8F=B2=EF=B8=8F Last chance to show your work! For those who regist=
ered without a=0D
   presentation, we welcome you to participate in a poster presentation=0D=

   session. If you would like to do so, please reply to this email with a=
=0D
   tentative title.=0D
   -=0D
=0D
   Also, for those of you who registered with a presentation, but did not=
=0D
   indicate a title yet, please send us a tentative title at your earlies=
t=0D
   convenience.=0D
   -=0D
=0D
   =F0=9F=9A=8C The easiest way to reach the workshop venue=0D
   <https://intra.tesaf.unipd.it/sanvito/english.asp> from Venice Airport=
=0D
   is by taking the bus cortina express 100=0D
   <https://www.cortinaexpress.it/it/san-vito-di-cadore/>. The bus stops =
at San=0D
   Vito di Cadore-Centro, and from there, you can have a nice walk and=0D=

   enjoy the view to reach the conference centre. Additional information =
can=0D
   be found on the workshop centre website=0D
   <https://intra.tesaf.unipd.it/sanvito/doc/LPT.pdf>.=0D
   -=0D
=0D
   =F0=9F=9B=8E=EF=B8=8F Here is a non-exhaustive list of possible accomm=
odation options.=0D
   -=0D
=0D
      https://dolomitimountainresort.com/=0D
      -=0D
=0D
      https://www.albergoantelao.it/=0D
      -=0D
=0D
      https://villasanvitocadore.it/=0D
      -=0D
=0D
      https://www.hotelmarcora.it/=0D
=0D
Other options can be found on Airbnb and Booking but keep in mind that we=
=0D
are in the low season and some hotels are not open yet. If you don=E2=80=99=
t have a=0D
car, we recommend finding accommodation either in San Vito or at least in=
 a=0D
town located on the bus 30 line=0D
<https://dolomitibus.it/it/linee-extraurbane-invernali> which connects to=
=0D
San Vito.=0D
Stay up-to-date!=0D
=0D
We would like to thank everyone for their support and participation and=0D=

look forward to seeing you at CATHY Days 2023.=0D
=0D
The workshop agenda will be sent soon with the next announcement and=0D
published on our website <https://cathy-org.github.io/CATHY_days_2023/>.=0D=

=0D
Don=E2=80=99t hesitate to contact us if you have any questions!=0D
=0D
Benjamin Mary,=0D
=0D
On behalf of the organization committee=0D
=0D
Daniele La Cecilia (Daniele.LaCecilia@eawag.ch), Matteo Camporese (=0D
matteo.camporese@unipd.it),  Claudio Paniconi (Claudio.Paniconi@inrs.ca),=
=0D
and Mario Putti (mario.putti@unipd.it)=0D
=0D
*The seminar is supported by Centro di Idrologia Dino Tonini=0D

